CONFIGURE DNS IN CISCO PACKET TRACER

PROCEDURE:
    1. Open cisco packet tracer application
    2. Pick and place all required devices
    3. Assign IP address and connect devices
    4. Configure DNS Server
    • IP: 192.168.1.10
    • Services → DNS → ON
    • Add:
    • Name: www.example.com
    • Address: 192.168.1.20
    5. Configure Web Server
    • IP: 192.168.1.20
    • Services → HTTP → ON
    6. Test
